                <pb facs="1506" n="1348" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1348"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Collier to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-05-31"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 31,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bomb thrown at King and Queen while returning to palace after wedding. Their
                    Majesties escaped uninjured. Royal carriage wrecked. Many of escort killed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Collier.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
